  "body": "Adds inspectable period wagon, carriage, horse and harness studies, alongside portable humans tied to existing reconstructed residents. The development collection loads the actual GLBs and exercises wheel/steering motion, horse clips, hitch/gear fit and exported geometry. These studies remain separate from populated town traffic and camera travel modes.\n\n- W01 wagon and C01 open carriage have articulated running gear and reconstructed construction details. The separate 1904 C02 enclosed-carriage study adds a roofed cabin and operable rigid door, with source/export checks at 15 discrete angles and desktop/mobile interaction views. These samples do not establish continuous or occupied collision safety.\n- Human authoring uses explicitly licensed source assets and existing references Otis Bardwell, Joseph Dufresne and Martin Flynn. It adds period workwear studies, grounded gait, hair and facial/export checks while preserving identity, scene-date and reconstructed-appearance disclosures. Pinned canonical Blender/export checks cover source/published surfaces, normal precision, hierarchy controls and actual sole contact; acceptance remains revision-specific.\n- The desktop qualification repair waits for the actual Navigator dock to settle before measuring HUD coverage and uses a single transparent pass only for the flat camera-facing grass-card material. Controlled local comparisons preserved full-frame pixels and restored the original state. The 330-call, 10% HUD and triangle ceilings are unchanged; the historical 331-call frame was not reproduced, and sampled ghost triangle overages remain documented.\n\nThese are reconstructed engineering assets, not photographic masters or attested likenesses, breeds, owners, matched historical turnouts or observed resident actions. Source rights and dating limits remain explicit. Horse anatomy/head/ear and gear refinements still need qualification; occupants, seated driving, mounting, boarding/riding, forces, complete collision behavior, production LODs and town traffic remain open. No ticket is closed by this PR description.\n\nValidation at `668e48180cfa20fe48b594041fcc0c0e2499ee72`: full preflight passed all 1,015 steps (377 deliberate refusal self-tests), with changelog/ticket checks and postcommit checks passing. Exact tested tree: `beeb06e4afbbca563f5f4f252f4e56cbd44b1b1e`. Fresh installed-build draw tracing, canonical human export, all 18 published smoke legs and normal PR checks are pending; earlier revision receipts remain supporting evidence only. The previous commit's moving-frames failure is unresolved while CI log access is blocked. This PR stays draft until the final head qualifies.\n",
